#### Solution Code
Here is the complete Java program. You may also want to look at the previous exercises to get some more practice.

```java
class Main {
    // Swap two numbers without temp variable
    public static void swap(int[] arr, int leftIndex, int rightIndex) {
        arr[leftIndex] = arr[leftIndex] + arr[rightIndex];
        arr[rightIndex] = arr[leftIndex] - arr[rightIndex];
        arr[leftIndex] = arr[leftIndex] - arr[rightIndex];
    }

    // Reverses an array
    public static int[] reverse(int[] arr) {
        int start = 0;
        int end = arr.length - 1;
        while (start < end) {
            swap(arr, start++, end--);
        }
        return arr;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] arr = { 1, 2, 3, 4 };
        int[] result = reverse(arr);
        for (int val : result) {
            System.out.print(val + " ");
        }
    }
}
